u011fi\u015fiklik g\u00f6sterecektir\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezs7je_name":"\u00c7ocu\u011fumun ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu vitamin ve mineraller sadece beslenme ile al\u0131namaz m\u0131?","lh_ezs7je_content_html":"Organik ve y\u00fcksek kaliteli meyve, sebze t\u00fcketimi ile \u00e7ocu\u011funuz ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131 olan vitamin ve mineralleri alabilir fakat g\u00fcnl\u00fck hayatta her g\u00fcn bu ihtiyac\u0131 kar\u015f\u0131lamak \u00e7ok kolay de\u011fildir. Vitacoral Multivitamin For Kids'in ihtiyaca uygun haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f patentli form\u00fcl\u00fc ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olan vitamin ve minerali kolayca alman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezxkh5_name":"Vitacoral Multivitamin For Kids ka\u00e7 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren kullan\u0131lmal\u0131?","lh_ezxkh5_content_html":"Vitacoral Multivitamin For Kids 4 ya\u015f\u0131ndan b\u00fcy\u00fck \u00e7ocuklar ve yeti\u015fkinler taraf\u0131ndan g\u00fcvenle kullan\u0131labilir. 1-4 ya\u015f aras\u0131 yar\u0131m \u00f6l\u00e7ek kullanabilir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f02xew_name":"Vitacoral Multivitamin For Kids'in tad\u0131 ve kokusu nas\u0131l?","lh_f02xew_content_html":"Vitacoral Multivitamin For Kids do\u011fal \u00e7ilek \u00f6z\u00fc ve stevia kullan\u0131larak \u00fcretilmi\u015ftir; \u015feker ve yapay tatland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 i\u00e7ermez.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f08acn_name":"Vitacoral Multivitamin al\u0131rken ba\u015fka takviyeler kullanabilir miyim?","lh_f08acn_content_html":"Evet, fakat i\u00e7eri\u011finde ayn\u0131 vitamin ve minerallerin a\u015f\u0131r\u0131 dozunu almamak i\u00e7in doktorunuza veya eczac\u0131n\u0131za dan\u0131\u015fman\u0131z \u00f6nerilir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0dnae_name":"Vitacoral Multivitamin alerji yapar m\u0131?","lh_f0dnae_content_html":"Form\u00fcl\u00fcnde alerjen bulunmamaktad\u0131r. Ancak herhangi bir bile\u015fene kar\u015f\u0131 hassasiyetiniz varsa kullanmadan \u00f6nce etiket kontrol\u00fc yapman\u0131z gerekir.<!--lh-liv